      "writtenOn": "2023-12-12T16:04:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is easier and a tiny bit more efficient memory-wise to store NetworkRequest directly (mNetworkRequest) and expose it via a getter, rather than duplicate its fields (e.g. mTransportTypes, mNetCapabilityNotMetered, etc).\n\nThen the constructor becomes simple enough to not need a Builder: NetworkRequestStateInfo(int packageUid, NetworkRequest networkRequest).\n\nThe constructor can also handle setting mNetworkRequestReceivedTime.",
